  "duration_s": 431.775896,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "您知道中国最绝美的秋日古村落是哪一个吗？有人说是洪村近九百年的徽州水乡，一池秋水倒映着半个村子。有人说是黄岭屋顶上摆满五彩的竹匾，一晒就是几百年错了，红村在上级就得讲完，黄岭也拿不到头名。真正排在榜首的那个村子，不是水乡，不是晒秋，整座村子就挂在一道大峡谷的峭壁边上。到了秋天，漫山红叶黄叶的头顶上，压着终年不化的积雪。今天咱们就来盘点中国十大最绝美的秋日古村落。话不多说，茶给您切好了，劳烦您顺手点个小红心，咱们这就开讲。第十名。指南村浙江杭州话，是想看江南的秋天。老底子杭州人第一反应准是他这座藏在临安六百米高山上的古老村落村里村外长得近五百棵数百年树龄的古树，单是明清留下来的古银杏和古风香，就有三百多克老屋，依着太湖源头的山势层叠错落。几百年来，村民就守着这片古树林，耕山种茶。每到深秋十一月，几百颗金黄的银杏和火红的枫箱遮天蔽日，红、黄落叶铺满青石台阶，风一吹，整座村子宛如浮在五彩云霞里。您踩着落叶往村里走，脚底下沙沙作响，满眼都是温润的暖色。这份藏在江南深处的秋日层次，您说算不算给秋天开了个好头？第九名，塔川安徽一县，他就挨着洪村，是个不大的徽派小山村，可秋天来了，名气一点不输邻居。塔川最出名的是村子四周，漫山遍野的乌漆树。乌渠这种树叶子变色是一步步来的，先由绿转黄，再从黄变橙，最后红的像着了火。十月下旬到十一月，同一面山坡上，绿的黄的、橙的、红的全摆在一起，像打翻了的调色盘。更妙的是，红叶底下还藏着粉墙黛瓦的老房子，颜色一浓一淡，一焰一素，摄影的人天不亮，就扛着相机往山上爬，就为等着一层光。您说这样的秋天，天谁看了不想多留几天。第八名，肇兴洞寨，贵州黎平，它号称千户洞寨，是全国规模最大的侗族村寨之一。寨子里立着五座鼓楼，一座座高高的木楼，层层叠叠的飞檐，据说全靠榫卯，咬合不用一颗铁钉。鼓楼周围是成片的吊脚楼。顺着山坡铺开秋收的时候，寨子四周的稻田全黄了，金灿灿的道浪一直涌到房脚下，家家户户的合架上都亮满了稻鼓。鼓楼是侗家人议事聚会、唱歌的地方。侗族大歌就是在这样的楼下唱出来的金黄的田木头的楼，再配上歌声。您说这是不是一副活着的丰收图第七名，太行山大商村，山西阳泉盂县。如果说前面几个是南方的温柔，那他就是北方的硬骨头。他建在太行山的悬崖边上，据说有一千多年的历史。房子全是石头垒的墙，石板盖的顶，一层层贴着崖壁往上挪，远远看去像一座挂在山上的小布达拉宫。深秋一到崖壁上，红叶烧成一片家家户户的墙头，树梢上挂满惊鸿的柿子红的叶红的柿，趁着灰青的石头屋，苍镜里透着热烈，住在这里的人，一辈子跟石头打交道。石头给了他们屋子，也给了他们脾气，您说这股子倔劲是不是也算一种美？第六名洪村安徽黄山一线讲到这儿，上级的分量就彻底重了。它是世界文化遗产，有着近九百年的岁月沉淀，整个村落被巧妙布局成一头卧着的羚牛。明代先祖从栖息引来，活水九曲十八弯，绕过一百四十多幢，明清古宅汇进月沼，再淌进南湖，家家门前清流潺潺。深秋时节，南湖明镜般的水面上映着粉墙晃瓦，岸边的枫叶红透了落进水里几挺，残荷立在水中央，急风一吹，整幅画跟着轻轻晃动，把水养的这么活，把秋天养的这么静，您说这到底是画还是村子？从第十到第六名指南，村把银杏和枫叶铺满了石板路，塔川的乌冲树把山染成了调色盘。赵兴洞寨的道浪涌到了鼓楼脚下，太行山大天村，把惊鸿的世子挂上了石崖，洪村，把整个秋天养进了一池水里。可他们还不是最绝美的，接下来第五道第一名更加惊艳。有一个村子，梯田一层层铺了几千级云海。就在田里翻有一个村子，守在中国的西北边境门口，就是白桦林和雪峰，可排在榜首的那一座。把几百座像碉堡一样的古宅立体悬在千米峡谷之上，头枕雪山，身披彩霞。他是哪座？他凭什么能排在洪村和晒秋圣地的前面，下一集已经同步更新，点开我的头像，进入主页就能看到点个关注，看看谁才是中国十大最绝美的秋日古村落。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00001",
      "start_ms": 300,
      "end_ms": 4660,
      "text": "您知道中国最绝美的秋日古村落是哪一个吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00002",
      "start_ms": 5140,
      "end_ms": 9080,
      "text": "有人说是洪村近九百年的徽州水乡，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00003",
      "start_ms": 9300,
      "end_ms": 12020,
      "text": "一池秋水倒映着半个村子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00004",
      "start_ms": 12380,
      "end_ms": 16500,
      "text": "有人说是黄岭屋顶上摆满五彩的竹匾，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00005",
      "start_ms": 16860,
      "end_ms": 19800,
      "text": "一晒就是几百年错了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00006",
      "start_ms": 20480,
      "end_ms": 22920,
      "text": "红村在上级就得讲完，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00007",
      "start_ms": 23400,
      "end_ms": 25180,
      "text": "黄岭也拿不到头名。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00008",
      "start_ms": 25600,
      "end_ms": 28120,
      "text": "真正排在榜首的那个村子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00009",
      "start_ms": 28240,
      "end_ms": 29140,
      "text": "不是水乡，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00010",
      "start_ms": 29440,
      "end_ms": 30390,
      "text": "不是晒秋，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00011",
      "start_ms": 31110,
      "end_ms": 35270,
      "text": "整座村子就挂在一道大峡谷的峭壁边上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00012",
      "start_ms": 35910,
      "end_ms": 36770,
      "text": "到了秋天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00013",
      "start_ms": 37130,
      "end_ms": 39630,
      "text": "漫山红叶黄叶的头顶上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00014",
      "start_ms": 39990,
      "end_ms": 42150,
      "text": "压着终年不化的积雪。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00015",
      "start_ms": 42490,
      "end_ms": 47830,
      "text": "今天咱们就来盘点中国十大最绝美的秋日古村落。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00016",
      "start_ms": 48530,
      "end_ms": 49330,
      "text": "话不多说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00017",
      "start_ms": 49930,
      "end_ms": 51190,
      "text": "茶给您切好了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00018",
      "start_ms": 51490,
      "end_ms": 53390,
      "text": "劳烦您顺手点个小红心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00019",
      "start_ms": 53750,
      "end_ms": 54710,
      "text": "咱们这就开讲。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00020",
      "start_ms": 55070,
      "end_ms": 55790,
      "text": "第十名。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00021",
      "start_ms": 56210,
      "end_ms": 59270,
      "text": "指南村浙江杭州话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00022",
      "start_ms": 59270,
      "end_ms": 61260,
      "text": "是想看江南的秋天。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00023",
      "start_ms": 61540,
      "end_ms": 73315,
      "text": "老底子杭州人第一反应准是他这座藏在临安六百米高山上的古老村落村里村外长得近五百棵数百年树龄的古树，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00024",
      "start_ms": 73880,
      "end_ms": 77280,
      "text": "单是明清留下来的古银杏和古风香，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00025",
      "start_ms": 77520,
      "end_ms": 79670,
      "text": "就有三百多克老屋，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00026",
      "start_ms": 79710,
      "end_ms": 83115,
      "text": "依着太湖源头的山势层叠错落。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00027",
      "start_ms": 83650,
      "end_ms": 84650,
      "text": "几百年来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00028",
      "start_ms": 84990,
      "end_ms": 87370,
      "text": "村民就守着这片古树林，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00029",
      "start_ms": 87530,
      "end_ms": 88725,
      "text": "耕山种茶。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00030",
      "start_ms": 89160,
      "end_ms": 90585,
      "text": "每到深秋十一月，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00031",
      "start_ms": 90970,
      "end_ms": 95175,
      "text": "几百颗金黄的银杏和火红的枫箱遮天蔽日，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00032",
      "start_ms": 95660,
      "end_ms": 97855,
      "text": "红、黄落叶铺满青石台阶，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00033",
      "start_ms": 98170,
      "end_ms": 98905,
      "text": "风一吹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00034",
      "start_ms": 99310,
      "end_ms": 102605,
      "text": "整座村子宛如浮在五彩云霞里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00035",
      "start_ms": 103050,
      "end_ms": 105015,
      "text": "您踩着落叶往村里走，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00036",
      "start_ms": 105520,
      "end_ms": 107185,
      "text": "脚底下沙沙作响，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00037",
      "start_ms": 107590,
      "end_ms": 109885,
      "text": "满眼都是温润的暖色。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00038",
      "start_ms": 110710,
      "end_ms": 113955,
      "text": "这份藏在江南深处的秋日层次，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00039",
      "start_ms": 114610,
      "end_ms": 117595,
      "text": "您说算不算给秋天开了个好头？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00040",
      "start_ms": 117980,
      "end_ms": 118675,
      "text": "第九名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00041",
      "start_ms": 119010,
      "end_ms": 120880,
      "text": "塔川安徽一县，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00042",
      "start_ms": 121540,
      "end_ms": 122740,
      "text": "他就挨着洪村，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00043",
      "start_ms": 123460,
      "end_ms": 125800,
      "text": "是个不大的徽派小山村，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00044",
      "start_ms": 126240,
      "end_ms": 127360,
      "text": "可秋天来了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00045",
      "start_ms": 127500,
      "end_ms": 129200,
      "text": "名气一点不输邻居。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00046",
      "start_ms": 129740,
      "end_ms": 132620,
      "text": "塔川最出名的是村子四周，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00047",
      "start_ms": 132740,
      "end_ms": 134640,
      "text": "漫山遍野的乌漆树。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00048",
      "start_ms": 135040,
      "end_ms": 139860,
      "text": "乌渠这种树叶子变色是一步步来的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00049",
      "start_ms": 140520,
      "end_ms": 142000,
      "text": "先由绿转黄，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00050",
      "start_ms": 142720,
      "end_ms": 144280,
      "text": "再从黄变橙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00051",
      "start_ms": 144720,
      "end_ms": 147220,
      "text": "最后红的像着了火。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00052",
      "start_ms": 147680,
      "end_ms": 149735,
      "text": "十月下旬到十一月，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00053",
      "start_ms": 150610,
      "end_ms": 152210,
      "text": "同一面山坡上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00054",
      "start_ms": 153050,
      "end_ms": 156350,
      "text": "绿的黄的、橙的、红的全摆在一起，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00055",
      "start_ms": 157190,
      "end_ms": 159330,
      "text": "像打翻了的调色盘。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00056",
      "start_ms": 160270,
      "end_ms": 161310,
      "text": "更妙的是，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00057",
      "start_ms": 161790,
      "end_ms": 167110,
      "text": "红叶底下还藏着粉墙黛瓦的老房子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00058",
      "start_ms": 167610,
      "end_ms": 169990,
      "text": "颜色一浓一淡，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00059",
      "start_ms": 170290,
      "end_ms": 171610,
      "text": "一焰一素，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00060",
      "start_ms": 172130,
      "end_ms": 173710,
      "text": "摄影的人天不亮，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00061",
      "start_ms": 173830,
      "end_ms": 175850,
      "text": "就扛着相机往山上爬，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00062",
      "start_ms": 176150,
      "end_ms": 177590,
      "text": "就为等着一层光。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00063",
      "start_ms": 178110,
      "end_ms": 179840,
      "text": "您说这样的秋天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00064",
      "start_ms": 179900,
      "end_ms": 181980,
      "text": "天谁看了不想多留几天。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00065",
      "start_ms": 182280,
      "end_ms": 182940,
      "text": "第八名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00066",
      "start_ms": 183580,
      "end_ms": 184800,
      "text": "肇兴洞寨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00067",
      "start_ms": 185340,
      "end_ms": 186420,
      "text": "贵州黎平，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00068",
      "start_ms": 187240,
      "end_ms": 189100,
      "text": "它号称千户洞寨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00069",
      "start_ms": 189460,
      "end_ms": 192640,
      "text": "是全国规模最大的侗族村寨之一。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00070",
      "start_ms": 193040,
      "end_ms": 195580,
      "text": "寨子里立着五座鼓楼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00071",
      "start_ms": 195979,
      "end_ms": 197720,
      "text": "一座座高高的木楼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00072",
      "start_ms": 198020,
      "end_ms": 199760,
      "text": "层层叠叠的飞檐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00073",
      "start_ms": 200120,
      "end_ms": 202080,
      "text": "据说全靠榫卯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00074",
      "start_ms": 202080,
      "end_ms": 204120,
      "text": "咬合不用一颗铁钉。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00075",
      "start_ms": 204880,
      "end_ms": 207420,
      "text": "鼓楼周围是成片的吊脚楼。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00076",
      "start_ms": 207840,
      "end_ms": 211390,
      "text": "顺着山坡铺开秋收的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00077",
      "start_ms": 211810,
      "end_ms": 214450,
      "text": "寨子四周的稻田全黄了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00078",
      "start_ms": 215130,
      "end_ms": 218390,
      "text": "金灿灿的道浪一直涌到房脚下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00079",
      "start_ms": 219010,
      "end_ms": 222230,
      "text": "家家户户的合架上都亮满了稻鼓。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00080",
      "start_ms": 223010,
      "end_ms": 228750,
      "text": "鼓楼是侗家人议事聚会、唱歌的地方。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00081",
      "start_ms": 229550,
      "end_ms": 236890,
      "text": "侗族大歌就是在这样的楼下唱出来的金黄的田木头的楼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00082",
      "start_ms": 237470,
      "end_ms": 238690,
      "text": "再配上歌声。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00083",
      "start_ms": 239110,
      "end_ms": 244525,
      "text": "您说这是不是一副活着的丰收图第七名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00084",
      "start_ms": 245390,
      "end_ms": 246895,
      "text": "太行山大商村，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00085",
      "start_ms": 247640,
      "end_ms": 249285,
      "text": "山西阳泉盂县。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00086",
      "start_ms": 250080,
      "end_ms": 252665,
      "text": "如果说前面几个是南方的温柔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00087",
      "start_ms": 253180,
      "end_ms": 255235,
      "text": "那他就是北方的硬骨头。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00088",
      "start_ms": 255860,
      "end_ms": 258205,
      "text": "他建在太行山的悬崖边上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00089",
      "start_ms": 258560,
      "end_ms": 260425,
      "text": "据说有一千多年的历史。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00090",
      "start_ms": 260940,
      "end_ms": 262905,
      "text": "房子全是石头垒的墙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00091",
      "start_ms": 263380,
      "end_ms": 264535,
      "text": "石板盖的顶，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00092",
      "start_ms": 264860,
      "end_ms": 267035,
      "text": "一层层贴着崖壁往上挪，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00093",
      "start_ms": 267490,
      "end_ms": 271465,
      "text": "远远看去像一座挂在山上的小布达拉宫。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00094",
      "start_ms": 272020,
      "end_ms": 274500,
      "text": "深秋一到崖壁上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00095",
      "start_ms": 274540,
      "end_ms": 278185,
      "text": "红叶烧成一片家家户户的墙头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00096",
      "start_ms": 278810,
      "end_ms": 283425,
      "text": "树梢上挂满惊鸿的柿子红的叶红的柿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00097",
      "start_ms": 283970,
      "end_ms": 285755,
      "text": "趁着灰青的石头屋，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00098",
      "start_ms": 286500,
      "end_ms": 288135,
      "text": "苍镜里透着热烈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00099",
      "start_ms": 288840,
      "end_ms": 289925,
      "text": "住在这里的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00100",
      "start_ms": 290290,
      "end_ms": 292225,
      "text": "一辈子跟石头打交道。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00101",
      "start_ms": 292900,
      "end_ms": 294760,
      "text": "石头给了他们屋子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00102",
      "start_ms": 295120,
      "end_ms": 296560,
      "text": "也给了他们脾气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00103",
      "start_ms": 297120,
      "end_ms": 301940,
      "text": "您说这股子倔劲是不是也算一种美？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00104",
      "start_ms": 302400,
      "end_ms": 308000,
      "text": "第六名洪村安徽黄山一线讲到这儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00105",
      "start_ms": 308220,
      "end_ms": 310200,
      "text": "上级的分量就彻底重了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00106",
      "start_ms": 310560,
      "end_ms": 312480,
      "text": "它是世界文化遗产，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00107",
      "start_ms": 313100,
      "end_ms": 315540,
      "text": "有着近九百年的岁月沉淀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00108",
      "start_ms": 316100,
      "end_ms": 320560,
      "text": "整个村落被巧妙布局成一头卧着的羚牛。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00109",
      "start_ms": 321020,
      "end_ms": 323450,
      "text": "明代先祖从栖息引来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00110",
      "start_ms": 323470,
      "end_ms": 325610,
      "text": "活水九曲十八弯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00111",
      "start_ms": 326110,
      "end_ms": 327710,
      "text": "绕过一百四十多幢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00112",
      "start_ms": 327810,
      "end_ms": 330390,
      "text": "明清古宅汇进月沼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00113",
      "start_ms": 330890,
      "end_ms": 332190,
      "text": "再淌进南湖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00114",
      "start_ms": 332710,
      "end_ms": 334650,
      "text": "家家门前清流潺潺。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00115",
      "start_ms": 335110,
      "end_ms": 336090,
      "text": "深秋时节，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00116",
      "start_ms": 336530,
      "end_ms": 341110,
      "text": "南湖明镜般的水面上映着粉墙晃瓦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00117",
      "start_ms": 341530,
      "end_ms": 346010,
      "text": "岸边的枫叶红透了落进水里几挺，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00118",
      "start_ms": 346130,
      "end_ms": 347990,
      "text": "残荷立在水中央，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00119",
      "start_ms": 348510,
      "end_ms": 349490,
      "text": "急风一吹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00120",
      "start_ms": 349910,
      "end_ms": 352365,
      "text": "整幅画跟着轻轻晃动，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00121",
      "start_ms": 352780,
      "end_ms": 354355,
      "text": "把水养的这么活，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00122",
      "start_ms": 354750,
      "end_ms": 356270,
      "text": "把秋天养的这么静，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00123",
      "start_ms": 356550,
      "end_ms": 359375,
      "text": "您说这到底是画还是村子？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00124",
      "start_ms": 359900,
      "end_ms": 362610,
      "text": "从第十到第六名指南，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00125",
      "start_ms": 362610,
      "end_ms": 366065,
      "text": "村把银杏和枫叶铺满了石板路，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00126",
      "start_ms": 366420,
      "end_ms": 370025,
      "text": "塔川的乌冲树把山染成了调色盘。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00127",
      "start_ms": 370460,
      "end_ms": 373715,
      "text": "赵兴洞寨的道浪涌到了鼓楼脚下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00128",
      "start_ms": 374090,
      "end_ms": 375370,
      "text": "太行山大天村，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00129",
      "start_ms": 375570,
      "end_ms": 378275,
      "text": "把惊鸿的世子挂上了石崖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00130",
      "start_ms": 378780,
      "end_ms": 379220,
      "text": "洪村，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00131",
      "start_ms": 379220,
      "end_ms": 381915,
      "text": "把整个秋天养进了一池水里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00132",
      "start_ms": 382250,
      "end_ms": 384315,
      "text": "可他们还不是最绝美的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00133",
      "start_ms": 384980,
      "end_ms": 387815,
      "text": "接下来第五道第一名更加惊艳。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00134",
      "start_ms": 388490,
      "end_ms": 389595,
      "text": "有一个村子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00135",
      "start_ms": 390040,
      "end_ms": 393710,
      "text": "梯田一层层铺了几千级云海。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00136",
      "start_ms": 393890,
      "end_ms": 396465,
      "text": "就在田里翻有一个村子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00137",
      "start_ms": 397080,
      "end_ms": 400025,
      "text": "守在中国的西北边境门口，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00138",
      "start_ms": 400390,
      "end_ms": 402625,
      "text": "就是白桦林和雪峰，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00139",
      "start_ms": 403020,
      "end_ms": 404785,
      "text": "可排在榜首的那一座。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00140",
      "start_ms": 405220,
      "end_ms": 409920,
      "text": "把几百座像碉堡一样的古宅立体悬在千米峡谷之上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00141",
      "start_ms": 410600,
      "end_ms": 411575,
      "text": "头枕雪山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00142",
      "start_ms": 412010,
      "end_ms": 413155,
      "text": "身披彩霞。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00143",
      "start_ms": 413570,
      "end_ms": 414395,
      "text": "他是哪座？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00144",
      "start_ms": 414850,
      "end_ms": 418425,
      "text": "他凭什么能排在洪村和晒秋圣地的前面，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00145",
      "start_ms": 418830,
      "end_ms": 420805,
      "text": "下一集已经同步更新，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00146",
      "start_ms": 421470,
      "end_ms": 422625,
      "text": "点开我的头像，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00147",
      "start_ms": 423230,
      "end_ms": 426515,
      "text": "进入主页就能看到点个关注，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_f72848ff9c5f770d_s00148",
      "start_ms": 426960,
      "end_ms": 431415,
      "text": "看看谁才是中国十大最绝美的秋日古村落。"
    }
  ],
